Hand-written from the documented shape of OpenAI's Decisions API (POST /v1/decisions):
the API reference at https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/decisions/methods/create,
the guide at https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/decisions, and the types of the
installed `openai` package (resources/decisions.d.ts). None of these files is a recording:
no live call has been made. Replace them with recorded responses when a valid key is available.

decision.json answers to the three questions of systemOneContract (predicate, choice, score)
refusal.json the same request with the second question refused
error-429.json a rate-limit error body
error-400.json an invalid-request error body
